---
/**
 * Website privacy notice. The app's full privacy policy lives in the app
 * (canonical: site.privacyPolicyUrl) and is linked, not duplicated, so there
 * is a single source of truth for App Store review.
 */
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How ezorder.io handles visitor data, and where to find the full EZ Order Printer app privacy policy."
  lastUpdated="28 September 2026"
>
  <p>
    This page covers the <strong>ezorder.io website</strong>. If you are looking for how the EZ Order
    Printer <strong>Shopify app</strong> handles store, order and customer data, read the
    <a href={site.privacyPolicyUrl}>full app privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What this website collects</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>No cookies, no analytics, no advertising pixels.</strong> The site is a set of static pages.
      We do not track you across pages or sites.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Hosting logs.</strong> The site is served by Cloudflare Pages. Like any web host, Cloudflare
      processes technical request data (IP address, user agent, requested URL) to deliver pages and
      protect against abuse.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Search stays in your browser.</strong> Blog search runs entirely on your device; your
      queries are never sent to us.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Messages you send us.</strong> If you use the contact form or email
      <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a>, we receive the details you
      include and use them only to answer you.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to the Shopify App Store, our documentation and the app itself. Those services are
    governed by their own privacy policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights and contact</h2>
  <p>
    To ask about, correct or delete information you have sent us, email
    <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
